<title>ARGENTINA: Argentine Central Bank places $178 million RPs.</title>
<headline>Argentine Central Bank places $178 million RPs.</headline>
<dateline>BUENOS AIRES 1997-01-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Argentina's Central Bank said Monday it had placed $178 million in overnight repurchase agreements at 9.0 percent.</p>
<p>In the interbank market, call money eased to 6.15 percent from 7.1 percent at the close Friday.</p>
<p>The U.S. dollar rose to 0.99984 pesos from 0.99945 at the close Friday.</p>
<p>((-- Buenos Aires Newsroom 541 318-0655))</p>
</text>
